      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://philadelphia.wiki/a/Northern_Liberties"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Today, the Piazza at Schmidt's serves as the neighborhood's bustling commercial hub.",
